#: ../../source/demos/sine_tracking.rst:2 ba1c8fa9a5dc4ec58b6a69d314442489
msgid "_`Sine tracking`"
msgstr "_`正弦跟踪`"

#: ../../source/demos/sine_tracking.rst:4 84e1dc2e2b7249d88dce3fd73e782c49
msgid "The speed reference is a 1 Hz sine of 50 rad/s amplitude — the scenario that exposes phase lag and amplitude collapse, which a step test cannot see."
msgstr "速度给定是 1 Hz、幅值 50 rad/s 的正弦——阶跃测不出的相位滞后与幅值塌陷，在这里会暴露。"

#: ../../source/demos/sine_tracking.rst:12 7aaec3efe41e4a5fac8c48fbf266a719
msgid "Measured speed against the reference (the first 0.25 s transient is trimmed off)"
msgstr "实测速度与给定对比（前 0.25 s 的建立过程已裁掉）"

#: ../../source/demos/sine_tracking.rst:14 e173f6db669e427ebec46d60e5d6c610
msgid "measured over two cycles"
msgstr "两个周期上的测量"

