#: ../../source/demos/sine_tracking.rst:18 1cc9e079cccc4378be639ffce6f40296
msgid "What to look for: the peak-to-peak swing stays at the reference amplitude (no collapse) and the worst error stays a few percent — the phase lag is visible but small, which is what a 250 rad/s speed loop buys you at 1 Hz."
msgstr "看点：峰峰值仍等于给定幅值（没有塌陷）、最大误差只有几个百分点——1 Hz 下 250 rad/s 的速度环买到的就是这点相位滞后。"
